{
  "description": "PR-07 segment 2: Relay mailbox envelope decoding (DSHBox interlock-relay-core EnvelopeCodec). 'request' = v1 decodeRequest(text, file), 'control' = v2 decodeControl(text, file). Both lists run in the legacy Kotlin LegacyRelayEnvelopeParityTest (upstream codec, Maven org.json) and in C# RelayEnvelopeParityTests. 'csharpOnly' cases follow Android libcore org.json (what Relay uses on the device) where Maven org.json differs, or are deliberate C# strictness. 'padTo' = append spaces until the text has that many UTF-16 chars. 'probe' = always rejected at decoding, so the on-device probe may write it into the real mailbox (nothing reaches an approval or a backend).",
